{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0CIK", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{P} = \\etale$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-etale-smooth-local-source-target}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-etale}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9de674b42c7dad8eeaf69acee096bb2008c2094087e056089addffb46bbc2c7a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:10a0521c21b5ccf7498aed65c31c59e9047decdc74ab85a92ad068ad8356a41a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001>tale<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if <MATH_0003> is DM and the equivalent conditions of\nLemma <REF_0001>\nhold with <MATH_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5651b39d4f903a716a1d8c1a9a3a78f1ad189ec19cda06efc8f6a423e725b9d4", "unit_id": "tag:0CIL:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CIK", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:74fdd50139366343beb7a101a9ff9ed9e9f5cbe165bc82491c813718d821485d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7c15a21b9ad50faee6efa47e414028f9d0deca2fda7c413c59161abdd72f3e5b", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe will use without further mention that this agrees with the already\nexisting notion of <ACCENT_0001>tale morphisms in case <MATH_0001> is representable\nby algebraic spaces or if <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> are\nrepresentable by algebraic spaces.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:83520ac9b785a9312539c60d66d9bceebad15c71991b865a2ed5765000363e17", "unit_id": "tag:0CIK:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CIK", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-etale}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5ab4ccecd36d91c7f9ecfc62395a50e9a509fd8540f2e6904f57b779ab71562d", "source_text": "The composition of <ACCENT_0001>tale morphisms is <ACCENT_0002>tale.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bef4c20d0976f3e9b77e654fd08fe70a9ad219e0c634f01cc6d3845f5e083890", "unit_id": "tag:0CIM:statement"}
